<<<
paralleled &c.; the anomaly is due to the -ll- of the previous syllable. 2. The noun used, where p. itself will not serve, is parallelism, not parallelity;
===
*paralleled* &c.; the anomaly is due to the -ll- of the previous syllable. 2. The noun used, where *p.* itself will not serve, is *parallelism*, not *parallelity*;
