| as organizers of physical training,

| are women readily finding interesting & important employment. The not merely part requires the inverted are women finding; the but part requires the uninverted women are 1. Exceptionally among `
===
*And not merely in schools & colleges, but as organizers of physical training,* are women readily finding *interesting & important employment.* The *not merely* part requires the inverted *are women finding*; the *but* part requires the uninverted *women are*
>>>

